'     `npm ci --offline` left that lockfile byte-identical and created no
'     node_modules (MEASURED, npm 11.19.0 on the host). [Inference] The image's
'     npm reads lockfileVersion 3 the same way; it is npm >= 7.
'   * CREDENTIALS: A --print CHILD READS THE PROVEO HOME.
'     printEnforcedPlan and runPrint (e2e/credentials_test.go) inherited the
'     operator's ~/.proveo. A usable Claude login there makes
'     credentials.AuthSuppressor withhold every key of a provider the
'     manifest owns, so claudecode's secret-store line named none of the 30
'     injected keys (reported). Both helpers set PROVEO_HOME to a t.TempDir().
