'     reportSandboxLogin run only without --print, and sbx's stored-credential
'     probe shapes a message the --print path never prints.
'     [Inference] PROVEO_ENV_FILE and a .env beside the invocation directory
'     still reach the key lookup; neither empties the secret-store line.
'   * SEED READY: PROBE AS THE AGENT'S UID, NOT THE IMAGE'S LAST USER.
'     hermes ends as `USER root` on purpose (defs/hermes/Dockerfile,
'     _spec/defs/hermes/hermes-paradigm.puml), and sbx exec without -u ran the
'     probe as that user, so the uid gate in launchReadyKit failed (reported).
'     sbxExecStatus now passes `-u 1000` (agentUID), the uid every kit step
'     names (internal/sbx/kit.go, MEASURED). The uid gate stays: it fails when
